{{Documentation}}
==How to use==
<code><nowiki>{{Nyanko|name|level|talents}}</nowiki></code>
*name is the name of the form you want to show
*level is the level of the cat
**If level is ?, then the icon used is the placeholder deploy icon and level is converted to 0
*talents are as follows:
**0 - No talents unlocked/unit doesn't have talents
**1 - One regular talent unlocked
**2 - Two regular talents unlocked
**3 - Three regular talents unlocked
**4 - Four regular talents unlocked
**5 - Five regular talents unlocked
**6 - Full regular talents unlocked (Certain units have six talents)
**7 - One Ultra Talent unlocked
**8 - Two  Ultra Talents unlocked
**9 - Three Ultra Talents unlocked

==Example Usage==
<tabber>
Basic=
<pre>
{{Nyanko|Mohawk Cat|20+90|0}}
</pre>
gives
{{Nyanko|Mohawk Cat|20+90|0}}
|-|
