{{Nyanko|Mohawk Cat|20+90|0
|Eraser Cat|20+90|0
|Courier Cat|50|0
|Balaluga|?|0
|Kasa Jizo|60|6
|God-Emperor Megidora|60|9
|Nuclear Blade Dragon King Berius|85|0}}
</pre>
gives
{{Nyanko|Mohawk Cat|20+90|0
|Eraser Cat|20+90|0
|Courier Cat|50|0
|Balaluga|?|0
|Kasa Jizo|60|6
|God-Emperor Megidora|60|9
|Nuclear Blade Dragon King Berius|85|0}}
</tabber>

